      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Hi. As author (and I am speaking in no other capacity), the main reason for the repeal is that the right to emigration also allows for civil litigation to be grounds to be denied the right to exit. This would be extremely discriminatory to anyone who works in an industry that has a lot of civil litigation, say construction or insurance.",
